{"172420":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/172420-QVRFOAha7oy5.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1bb43","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx172420-4LjhmwpNMHti.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx172420-4LjhmwpNMHti.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx172420-4LjhmwpNMHti.jpg"},"description":"\u003cb\u003eREACH OUT AND GRASP GREATNESS.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nJungle Pocket, known to her close friends as \"Pokke,\" is a free-spirited Umamusume who has proven her dominance in the freestyle racing scene. Overwhelmed by Fuji Kiseki's majestic performance at a graded Twinkle Series race, she resolves to take on the Twinkle Series herself.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nShortly after joining the Umamusume training school Tracen Academy, Pokke comes under the wing of Tanabe, a veteran trainer who fostered Fuji Kiseki's talent. Together, they aspire to dominate the Triple Crown series, a set of three races that can only be attempted once in a lifetime. Awaiting them are formidable rivals of Pokke's generation, whose talents surpass even her own.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThere's Dantsu Flame, whose diligence and determination to win are second to none; Manhattan Cafe, who chases the shadowy silhouette of a \"friend\" that only she can see; and Agnes Tachyon, a veritable mad scientist seeking to push the very boundaries of what is possible for Umamusume.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThese four runners take to the track with their very pride, spirit, and souls on the line. Past the finish of their epic clash is a door waiting to be opened—one that leads to the beginning of a new era.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003e\"It doesn't matter who stands in my way! I'm gonna be the greatest!\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Beginning of a New Era Site)","duration":108,"endDate":{"day":24,"month":5,"year":2024},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Drama","Psychological","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":172420,"idMal":57647,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":87,"relations":{"edges":[{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98514-0uYzay4a1iiL.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e47850","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx98514-mEh3Gl58AWgc.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx98514-mEh3Gl58AWgc.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx98514-mEh3Gl58AWgc.jpg"},"description":"In a world very much like our own, great race horses of the past have a chance to be reborn as \"horse girls\"—girls with the ears and tails of horses as well as their speed and endurance. The best of these horse girls go to train at Tokyo's Tracen Academy, hopefully moving on to fame and fortune as both racers and idols.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nSpecial Week, a high school horse girl from the countryside, has just transferred to Tracen, and she's determined to fulfill her promise to her mother to become the best horse girl in Japan. On her way to school, she takes a pit stop at the race track and instantly falls in love with Silence Suzuka's style, becoming determined to race on the same team as her.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network) ","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":18,"month":6,"year":2018},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Music","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":98514,"idMal":35249,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2018,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/98514","startDate":{"day":2,"month":4,"year":2018},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["สาวม้าโมเอะ"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby"},"trailer":{"id":"WlDbeKNVtBo","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WlDbeKNVtBo/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"PARENT"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/148370-rYivpA9giZYc.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5086fe","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg"},"description":"The new anime will depict T.M. Opera O, Admire Vega, Narita Top Road, and other Uma Musume (Horse Girls) going head-to-head to win Classic competitions.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":7,"month":5,"year":2023},"episodes":4,"format":"ONA","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":148370,"idMal":51761,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":80,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2023,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/148370","startDate":{"day":16,"month":4,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top","ウマ娘ロードトゥーザトップ","Uma Musume: Pretty Derby RTTT"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー ROAD TO THE TOP","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top"},"trailer":{"id":"SQ7rv98fgH4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SQ7rv98fgH4/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"PREQUEL"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/176299-dtVaXMPJWVrF.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5d86e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx176299-9LocW6ylWFhm.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx176299-9LocW6ylWFhm.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx176299-9LocW6ylWFhm.jpg"},"description":"Theatrical version of \u003ci\u003eUma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP\u003c/i\u003e which includes new extra scenes.","duration":99,"endDate":{"day":10,"month":5,"year":2024},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":176299,"idMal":58517,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/176299","startDate":{"day":10,"month":5,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["ウマ娘ロードトゥーザトップ","Uma Musume: Pretty Derby RTTT"],"title":{"native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー ROAD TO THE TOP 劇場用再編集版","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP Movie","userPreferred":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP Movie"},"trailer":{"id":"ka62Zuurh-c","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ka62Zuurh-c/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"PREQUEL"}]},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/172420","startDate":{"day":24,"month":5,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Uma Musume: Pretty Derby Movie","劇場版 ウマ娘 プリティーダービー","ウマ娘 プリティーダービー BEGINNING OF A NEW ERA"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Beginning of a New Era","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー 新時代の扉","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - Shin Jidai no Tobira","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Beginning of a New Era"},"trailer":{"id":"h4dMQOzj-5g","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/h4dMQOzj-5g/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:27:18.229009197+05:30"},"174576":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/174576-6stJnscy5rCi.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4865d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx174576-tpKcHG0eO6CS.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx174576-tpKcHG0eO6CS.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx174576-tpKcHG0eO6CS.jpg"},"description":"A hard-working boy named Will enters a magic academy in hopes of becoming a great sorcerer. Unfortunately, there's a fatal flaw in his plan: he lacks the ability to use magic. Amid the cold stares of his classmates and instructors, Will feels discouraged at times, but he presses forward with unwavering determination. He can't use a wand, but he can wield a sword in his battle to reach the top of a magic-dominated world. He just needs to believe in his own unique strengths and remember the promise he made with someone precious to him...\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":29,"month":9,"year":2024},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":174576,"idMal":58059,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"relations":{"edges":[{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/125116-XzHAN4qtk41l.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#0daee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx125116-ZfCpel1WOdmF.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/bx125116-ZfCpel1WOdmF.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/small/bx125116-ZfCpel1WOdmF.jpg"},"description":"Will Serfort dreams of keeping his promise to a childhood friend by becoming a Magia Vander, one of the mighty magicians who sit atop the Wizard's Tower. However, he is unable to cast even the simplest of spells, leaving him to fight dungeon monsters to earn credits at Regarden Magical Academy. As if that weren't enough, he finds himself putting his sword skills to the test against a bullying professor!\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Kodansha USA)","endDate":{},"format":"MANGA","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":125116,"idMal":131924,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/manga/125116","startDate":{"day":9,"month":12,"year":2020},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["The Wistoria of Staves and Swords","ดาบและคทาแห่งวิสตอเรีย","Wistoria – Zauberstab \u0026 Schwert"],"title":{"english":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword","native":"杖と剣のウィストリア","romaji":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria","userPreferred":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword"},"trailer":{"id":"g2l02QKRBJY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/g2l02QKRBJY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"MANGA"},"relationType":"SOURCE"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182300-d1znfWKzn1bT.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4a150","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx182300-IYkq5KrkQq1V.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx182300-IYkq5KrkQq1V.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx182300-IYkq5KrkQq1V.jpg"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eTsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria\u003c/i\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWill, a washout student at a magical academy who is unable to use magic, is aiming to join the top tier of mages, the Magia Vander, to fulfill a promise to his childhood friend, Elfaria. Wielding a sword instead of a wand, his abilities are slowly recognized within the academy. During the all-student praxis dungeon training he undertakes with Lihanna and the other top students of his year, they are ambushed by a mysterious mage. Though they barely manage to survive the attack together, they go on to face the exit exam. Can Will reach the girl waiting for him in the tower?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Official Site)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":28,"month":6,"year":2026},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":182300,"idMal":59983,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":82,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1782027000,"episode":11,"timeUntilAiring":472154},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/182300","startDate":{"day":12,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["ตำนานดาบและคทาแห่งวิสตอเรีย ซีซั่น 2","Tongkat Sihir dan Pedang Wistoria Season 2"],"title":{"english":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword Season 2","native":"杖と剣のウィストリア Season2","romaji":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria Season 2","userPreferred":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"57OL0uTIBVg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/57OL0uTIBVg/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SEQUEL"}]},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/174576","startDate":{"day":7,"month":7,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["杖與劍的魔劍譚","ตำนานดาบและคทาแห่งวิสตอเรีย","Wistoria: Varinhas e Espadas"],"title":{"english":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword","native":"杖と剣のウィストリア","romaji":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria","userPreferred":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword"},"trailer":{"id":"FNiBiXXeyb8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FNiBiXXeyb8/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:50:46.623210691+05:30"},"182300":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182300-d1znfWKzn1bT.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4a150","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx182300-IYkq5KrkQq1V.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx182300-IYkq5KrkQq1V.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx182300-IYkq5KrkQq1V.jpg"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eTsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria\u003c/i\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWill, a washout student at a magical academy who is unable to use magic, is aiming to join the top tier of mages, the Magia Vander, to fulfill a promise to his childhood friend, Elfaria. Wielding a sword instead of a wand, his abilities are slowly recognized within the academy. During the all-student praxis dungeon training he undertakes with Lihanna and the other top students of his year, they are ambushed by a mysterious mage. Though they barely manage to survive the attack together, they go on to face the exit exam. Can Will reach the girl waiting for him in the tower?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Official Site)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":28,"month":6,"year":2026},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":182300,"idMal":59983,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":82,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1782027000,"episode":11,"timeUntilAiring":472161},"relations":{"edges":[{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/174576-6stJnscy5rCi.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4865d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx174576-tpKcHG0eO6CS.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx174576-tpKcHG0eO6CS.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx174576-tpKcHG0eO6CS.jpg"},"description":"A hard-working boy named Will enters a magic academy in hopes of becoming a great sorcerer. Unfortunately, there's a fatal flaw in his plan: he lacks the ability to use magic. Amid the cold stares of his classmates and instructors, Will feels discouraged at times, but he presses forward with unwavering determination. He can't use a wand, but he can wield a sword in his battle to reach the top of a magic-dominated world. He just needs to believe in his own unique strengths and remember the promise he made with someone precious to him...\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":29,"month":9,"year":2024},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":174576,"idMal":58059,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/174576","startDate":{"day":7,"month":7,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["杖與劍的魔劍譚","ตำนานดาบและคทาแห่งวิสตอเรีย","Wistoria: Varinhas e Espadas"],"title":{"english":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword","native":"杖と剣のウィストリア","romaji":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria","userPreferred":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword"},"trailer":{"id":"FNiBiXXeyb8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FNiBiXXeyb8/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"PREQUEL"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/125116-XzHAN4qtk41l.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#0daee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx125116-ZfCpel1WOdmF.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/bx125116-ZfCpel1WOdmF.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/small/bx125116-ZfCpel1WOdmF.jpg"},"description":"Will Serfort dreams of keeping his promise to a childhood friend by becoming a Magia Vander, one of the mighty magicians who sit atop the Wizard's Tower. However, he is unable to cast even the simplest of spells, leaving him to fight dungeon monsters to earn credits at Regarden Magical Academy. As if that weren't enough, he finds himself putting his sword skills to the test against a bullying professor!\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Kodansha USA)","endDate":{},"format":"MANGA","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":125116,"idMal":131924,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/manga/125116","startDate":{"day":9,"month":12,"year":2020},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["The Wistoria of Staves and Swords","ดาบและคทาแห่งวิสตอเรีย","Wistoria – Zauberstab \u0026 Schwert"],"title":{"english":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword","native":"杖と剣のウィストリア","romaji":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria","userPreferred":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword"},"trailer":{"id":"g2l02QKRBJY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/g2l02QKRBJY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"MANGA"},"relationType":"SOURCE"}]},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/182300","startDate":{"day":12,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["ตำนานดาบและคทาแห่งวิสตอเรีย ซีซั่น 2","Tongkat Sihir dan Pedang Wistoria Season 2"],"title":{"english":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword Season 2","native":"杖と剣のウィストリア Season2","romaji":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria Season 2","userPreferred":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"57OL0uTIBVg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/57OL0uTIBVg/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:50:39.316267901+05:30"},"189046":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/189046-MDk2CaVuRWpb.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e49350","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx189046-yaHWtS5FII46.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx189046-yaHWtS5FII46.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx189046-yaHWtS5FII46.jpg"},"description":"The fourth season of \u003ci\u003eRe:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu\u003c/i\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nTo save his stricken allies, Subaru faces a deadly desert to find the Sage at Pleiades Watchtower.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)\n\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Episode 1 pre-screened at Lucca Comics \u0026 Games on November 1, 2025, before the Japanese television broadcast.","duration":24,"endDate":{},"episodes":19,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Psychological","Romance"],"id":189046,"idMal":61316,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":88,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1781701200,"episode":11,"timeUntilAiring":146176},"relations":{"edges":[{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/163134-CqaXjXVivwJ5.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#bbd6f1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx163134-yieRFbvUOH9a.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx163134-yieRFbvUOH9a.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx163134-yieRFbvUOH9a.jpg"},"description":"The third season of \u003ci\u003eRe:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu\u003c/i\u003e. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nA year has passed since Subaru’s victory at the Sanctuary. He savors a life of fulfillment while Emilia’s camp stands united for the royal selection—until a fateful letter arrives. Anastasia, a royal selection candidate, has invited Emilia to the Watergate City of Priestella. But as the party begins its journey, crisis stirs beneath the surface and Subaru meets a cruel fate once again.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll) \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n\u003ci\u003eNote: The first episode has an extended runtime of ~90 minutes, and received an early premiere at Anime Expo on July 5, 2024.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":26,"month":3,"year":2025},"episodes":16,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Psychological","Romance","Thriller"],"id":163134,"idMal":54857,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":84,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/163134","startDate":{"day":2,"month":10,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Re:ZERO – Жизнь с нуля в альтернативном мире 3"],"title":{"english":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- Season 3","native":"Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活 3rd season","romaji":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu 3rd Season","userPreferred":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- Season 3"},"trailer":{"id":"qMJNdQFPaHk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qMJNdQFPaHk/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"PREQUEL"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85737-jCG8ine3fTDr.png","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85737-WkWOr5EgwPyo.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/bx85737-WkWOr5EgwPyo.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/small/bx85737-WkWOr5EgwPyo.jpg"},"description":"Subaru Natsuki was just trying to get to the convenience store but wound up summoned to another world. He encounters the usual things--life-threatening situations, silver haired beauties, cat fairies--you know, normal stuff. All that would be bad enough, but he's also gained the most inconvenient magical ability of all--time travel, but he's got to die to use it. How do you repay someone who saved your life when all you can do is die?\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Yen Press)","endDate":{},"format":"NOVEL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Psychological","Romance","Thriller"],"id":85737,"idMal":74697,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":88,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/manga/85737","startDate":{"day":24,"month":1,"year":2014},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["ReZero","Re: Life in a different world from zero","Re:Zero - Życie w innym świecie od zera","Re:Zero - Жизнь с нуля в альтернативном мире","Re: Zero - Bắt đầu lại ở thế giới khác","Re:Zero รีเซทชีวิต ฝ่าวิกฤตต่างโลก","Re:Zero – Começando Uma Vida em Outro Mundo","Re:Zero - Re:vivre dans un autre monde à partir de zéro"],"title":{"english":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-","native":"Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活","romaji":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu","userPreferred":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-"},"trailer":{"id":"jTmeuNBYB7g","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jTmeuNBYB7g/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"MANGA"},"relationType":"SOURCE"},{"node":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#a1e4c9","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx210687-H54G1bTwCBpV.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx210687-H54G1bTwCBpV.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx210687-H54G1bTwCBpV.jpg"},"description":"The fourth season of Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Kyuukei Jikan (Break Time).","duration":3,"endDate":{},"format":"ONA","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":210687,"idMal":63830,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1781703000,"episode":11,"timeUntilAiring":147976},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/210687","startDate":{"day":8,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["Re:ZERO ~Starting Break Time From Zero~ Season 4"],"title":{"native":"Re:ゼロから始める休憩時間(ブレイクタイム) 4th Season","romaji":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Kyuukei Jikan (Break Time) 4th Season","userPreferred":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Kyuukei Jikan (Break Time) 4th Season"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SPIN_OFF"}]},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/189046","startDate":{"day":8,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["Re:ZERO รีเซทชีวิต ฝ่าวิกฤตต่างโลก ซีซั่น 4","Re:ZERO – Жизнь с нуля в альтернативном мире 4"],"title":{"english":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- Season 4","native":"Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活 4th season","romaji":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu 4th Season","userPreferred":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- Season 4"},"trailer":{"id":"i8EjBP85cCc","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/i8EjBP85cCc/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:53:45.466871542+05:30"},"196017":{"value":{"Media":{"id":196017,"idMal":62051,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/196017","status":"RELEASING","season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"type":"ANIME","format":"TV","isAdult":false,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","meanScore":72,"description":"The anime's story is set in the late 1950s and early 1960s, during the height of Japan's economic boom, when the circus is a major form of entertainment. Different circus troupes travel throughout Japan to perform and compete for a chance to participate in the world-renowned festival called \"Circus Collection.\" One troupe called the \"Sunflower Circus,\" led by its ringmaster Maria, travels around Japan to perform, despite struggling with financial difficulties. However, they meet a circus prodigy named Mizuka Tsurumaki. This is the story of a one-of-a-kind circus show of young girls with big dreams.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":24,"trailer":{"id":"PAneuhZLHzU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PAneuhZLHzU/hqdefault.jpg"},"title":{"english":"Grow Up Show","native":"グロウアップショウ ～ひまわりのサーカス団～","romaji":"Grow Up Show: Himawari no Circus-dan","userPreferred":"Grow Up Show"},"coverImage":{"color":"#f1ae1a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx196017-GynDNdbDzqzk.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx196017-GynDNdbDzqzk.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx196017-GynDNdbDzqzk.jpg"},"startDate":{"day":5,"month":7,"year":2026},"endDate":{},"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784386800,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":583793},"relations":{}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-12T02:20:08.118575494+05:30"},"21":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21-wf37VakJmZqs.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e49335","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21-ELSYx3yMPcKM.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21-ELSYx3yMPcKM.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21-ELSYx3yMPcKM.jpg"},"description":"Gold Roger was known as the Pirate King, the strongest and most infamous being to have sailed the Grand Line. The capture and death of Roger by the World Government brought a change throughout the world. His last words before his death revealed the location of the greatest treasure in the world, One Piece. It was this revelation that brought about the Grand Age of Pirates, men who dreamed of finding One Piece (which promises an unlimited amount of riches and fame), and quite possibly the most coveted of titles for the person who found it, the title of the Pirate King.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nEnter Monkey D. Luffy, a 17-year-old boy that defies your standard definition of a pirate. Rather than the popular persona of a wicked, hardened, toothless pirate who ransacks villages for fun, Luffy’s reason for being a pirate is one of pure wonder; the thought of an exciting adventure and meeting new and intriguing people, along with finding One Piece, are his reasons of becoming a pirate. Following in the footsteps of his childhood hero, Luffy and his crew travel across the Grand Line, experiencing crazy adventures, unveiling dark mysteries and battling strong enemies, all in order to reach One Piece.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cb\u003e*This includes the following special episodes:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n- Chopperman to the Rescue! Protect the TV Station by the Shore! (Episode 336)\u003cbr\u003e\n- The Strongest Tag-Team! Luffy and Toriko's Hard Struggle! (Episode 492)\u003cbr\u003e\n- Team Formation! Save Chopper (Episode 542)\u003cbr\u003e\n- History's Strongest Collaboration vs. Glutton of the Sea (Episode 590)\u003cbr\u003e\n- 20th Anniversary! Special Romance Dawn (Episode 907)","duration":24,"endDate":{},"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":21,"idMal":21,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":87,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1782051360,"episode":1167,"timeUntilAiring":496408},"relations":{"edges":[{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/466-uS8J4XwJ35Ws.png","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e49328","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx466-bVP54I7dCB2F.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx466-bVP54I7dCB2F.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx466-bVP54I7dCB2F.jpg"},"description":"While Luffy and his crew of Zoro and Nami are starving on their small boat, they are attacked by a large monster. Nami is taken away, while Luffy and Zoro wash up on shore. There they meet a young girl, Medaka, and learn of the sad history of the island. The evil Pirate Ganzack has taken away all the men in the village and enslaved them, including Medaka's father. Now Luffy, Zoro, and Medaka must infiltrate Ganzack's base in order to rescue the villagers and Nami. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":28,"endDate":{"day":26,"month":7,"year":1998},"episodes":1,"format":"OVA","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":466,"idMal":466,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":64,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":1998,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/466","startDate":{"day":26,"month":7,"year":1998},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Defeat Him! The Pirate Ganzack!","ONE PIECE ジャンプスーパーアニメツアー'98","ONE PIECE Jump Super Anime Tour '98"],"title":{"english":"One Piece: Defeat the Pirate Ganzack!","native":"ONE PIECE 倒せ!海賊ギャンザック","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Taose! Kaizoku Ganzack","userPreferred":"One Piece: Defeat the Pirate Ganzack!"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1094-IAIqiFbLBsig.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1a10d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1094-H3YFJ1TR0ZZi.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx1094-H3YFJ1TR0ZZi.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1094-H3YFJ1TR0ZZi.jpg"},"description":"The Straw Hats encounter a city in the middle of a whirlpool, called the Ocean's Navel, that is being destroyed by giant monsters. These monsters supposedly protect a treasure capable of granting wishes, but in the process of defeating these guardians, the crew ends up releasing another evil.  (aired after Episode 53)\u003cbr\u003e","duration":49,"endDate":{"day":20,"month":12,"year":2000},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":1094,"idMal":1094,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":67,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2000,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/1094","startDate":{"day":20,"month":12,"year":2000},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece: Avventura nell'ombelico dell'oceano","One Piece Special: Adventure in the Ocean's Navel","วันพีซ ภาคพิเศษ 1 การผจญภัยใต้มหาสมุทร","Vua Hải Tặc: Cuộc phiêu lưu vào rốn đại dương","One Piece Special: Luffy Falls! Adventure in the Navel of the Sea"],"title":{"english":"One Piece: Umi no Heso no Daibouken-hen","native":"ONE PIECE TVスペシャル 海のヘソの大冒険篇","romaji":"ONE PIECE TV Special: Umi no Heso no Daibouken-hen","userPreferred":"One Piece: Umi no Heso no Daibouken-hen"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1237-hHWuRsuVsVpr.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4ae35","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/1237.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/1237.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1237.jpg"},"description":"The story opens on Pirate Zap's ship, where two of his crew, Bonnie and Max, are tired and want to escape, but unfortunately they have no money. Three children were being held captive on the ship overhear them. The eldest, Amanda, who's father was a pro treasure hunter, knows the whereabouts of a great treasure, and offers them a deal. If they help them make a clean escape, they could take all the treasure they wanted. They agree, and the five of them barely escape and make it onto a small island where they meet Luffy and his crew. Unfortunately they were pursued and Luffy and Amanda are captured and brought back to their boss, the head of the Bayan Pirates, who is also after the treasure. Now Luffy and the others must battle the Bayan pirates and find the treasure that Amanda's father had left for his children. Amanda, who has always resented adventure and treasure because her father was constantly gone in search for it, finally understands his feelings. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":46,"endDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2003},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":1237,"idMal":1237,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":67,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2003,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/1237","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2003},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece: Un tesoro grande un sogno","วันพีซ ภาคพิเศษ 2 ออกสู่ทะเลกว้างใหญ่ ความฝันอันยิ่งใหญ่ของพ่อ","Vua Hải Tặc: Vươn ra đại dương! Giấc mơ to lớn của bố!"],"title":{"english":"One Piece Special: Open Upon the Great Sea! A Father's Huge, HUGE Dream!","native":"ONE PIECE: 大海原にひらけ! でっかいでっカイ父の夢","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Oounabara ni Hirake! Dekkai Dekkai Chichi no Yume!","userPreferred":"One Piece Special: Open Upon the Great Sea! A Father's Huge, HUGE Dream!"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1238-HdBlNr5vwNau.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5dc9f1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1238-Rf2wqBrCwgvO.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx1238-Rf2wqBrCwgvO.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1238-Rf2wqBrCwgvO.jpg"},"description":"For many years, Ex-Marine Lieutenant Randolph and his troupe have put on a play aboard his ship. Having lost his family to pirates, Randolph wishes to put on plays that will give courage to those who have also lost their loved ones to pirates. Unfortunately, Randolph must retire soon, and he is now giving his last performance. Luffy and his crew come to see the play, and somehow manage to take part in it themselves. But from Randolph's past comes a vengeful subordinate with a diabolical plan who has finally become commander in order to capture Randolph. Luffy and his nakama now must prove to the people that not all pirates are scum, and protect Randolph's final farewell performance from the bitter commander. (aired after Episode 174)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":45,"endDate":{"day":14,"month":12,"year":2003},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":1238,"idMal":1238,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":69,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2003,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/1238","startDate":{"day":14,"month":12,"year":2003},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece TV Special 3","One Piece: L'ultima esibizione","守れ!最後の大舞台","One Piece: Mamore! Saigo no Daibutai","One Piece Special: Protect! The Last Great Stage","วันพีซ ภาคพิเศษ 3 ป้องกันการแสดงครั้งสุดท้ายอันยิ่งใหญ่ ","Vua Hải Tặc: Bảo vệ! Vở diễn lớn cuối cùng","ONE PIECE TVスペシャル3 守れ! 最後の大舞台"],"title":{"english":"One Piece Special: Protect! The Last Great Performance","native":"ONE PIECE 守れ! 最後の大舞台","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Mamore! Saigo no Oobutai","userPreferred":"One Piece Special: Protect! The Last Great Performance"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2020-k3lHutyP9i06.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1bb35","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2020.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2020.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2020.jpg"},"description":"Unlike the other specials, this story takes place in an alternate reality version of 19th century Japan, in \"The Grand Jipangu\", an alternate version of The Grand Line as opposed to simply being hour-long filler episodes.The story is divided into two halves: in the first, Buggy the Clown makes trouble in the town where Detective Luffy is stationed, and in the second a mysterious girl named Vivi appears. These stories feature cameos from several minor characters in the normal series. Surprisingly the \"Oyabun\" (Boss) specials did not stop there as five more specials were made following the first one, mostly as Christmas and New Years specials as well as fillers once in awhile.\u003cbr\u003e","duration":44,"endDate":{"day":18,"month":12,"year":2005},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":2020,"idMal":2020,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":68,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2005,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/2020","startDate":{"day":18,"month":12,"year":2005},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece: Le avventure del detective Cappello di Paglia"],"title":{"english":"One Piece Special: The Detective Memoirs of Chief Straw Hat Luffy","native":"ONE PIECE 年末特別企画！麦わらのルフィ親分捕物帖","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Nenmatsu Tokubetsu Kikaku! Mugiwara no Luffy Oyabun Torimonochou","userPreferred":"One Piece Special: The Detective Memoirs of Chief Straw Hat Luffy"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2386-jtduFM8raO2z.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#d6931a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2386-NQQkq1taHJ08.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2386-NQQkq1taHJ08.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2386-NQQkq1taHJ08.jpg"},"description":"Luffy and his crew take on the Villain All-Stars in a game of soccer in order to become the Dream Soccer King. The game comes down to a pk tie-breaker shoot-out with Coby as goalie and Helmeppo refereeing.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network) ","duration":5,"endDate":{"day":2,"month":3,"year":2002},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Comedy","Fantasy","Sports"],"id":2386,"idMal":2386,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":66,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2002,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/2386","startDate":{"day":2,"month":3,"year":2002},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece: Dream Soccer King!"],"title":{"native":"ONE PIECE 夢のサッカー王!","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Yume no Soccer Ou!","userPreferred":"ONE PIECE: Yume no Soccer Ou!"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2490-wlPYONPyTibY.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#ffbb43","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2490-AL4WmnCJ5zvE.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2490-AL4WmnCJ5zvE.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2490-AL4WmnCJ5zvE.jpg"},"description":"Luffy and crew takes on Arlong's crew in baseball. Announced by Bon Clay and Buggy.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":5,"endDate":{"day":6,"month":3,"year":2004},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Comedy","Fantasy","Sports"],"id":2490,"idMal":2490,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":64,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2004,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/2490","startDate":{"day":6,"month":3,"year":2004},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece: Take Aim! The Pirate Baseball King"],"title":{"native":"ONE PIECE めざせ! 海賊野球王","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Mezase! Kaizoku Yakyuu Ou","userPreferred":"ONE PIECE: Mezase! Kaizoku Yakyuu Ou"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n12001-IljdXqN8CTU7.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1e435","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx12001-XX0NNNfaKZ3e.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx12001-XX0NNNfaKZ3e.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx12001-XX0NNNfaKZ3e.jpg"},"description":"Toei Animation released a new 3D anime short at events starting December 1, 2011. The short run about 12 minutes long and played at stereoscopic 3D theaters at Aichi Prefecture's Lagunasia theme park, Nagasaki Prefecture's Huis Ten Bosch theme park, Kanagawa Prefecture's Yokohama Landmark Tower, and Hiroshima Prefecture's NTT CRED Hall.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":12,"endDate":{"day":1,"month":12,"year":2011},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy"],"id":12001,"idMal":12001,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":61,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2011,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/12001","startDate":{"day":1,"month":12,"year":2011},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"native":"ONE PIECE 3D 激走! トラップコースター","romaji":"ONE PIECE 3D: Gekisou! Trap Coaster","userPreferred":"ONE PIECE 3D: Gekisou! Trap Coaster"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/16239-pov53U1T1dRm.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1c900","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b16239-XzoVjd7JK8xJ.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b16239-XzoVjd7JK8xJ.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b16239-XzoVjd7JK8xJ.png"},"description":"The story of the Hand Island no Bouken special is set a little before the events of One Piece Film Z and depicts a major \"Hand Island\" incident during the New World storyline. The story is set at \"Cannon Town\" where a parent and a child work as craftspeople. The incident revolves around them and a commodore of a marine base. The special will also have a flashback scene to the story in the first chapter of the manga, but with new animation. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network) ","duration":102,"endDate":{"day":15,"month":12,"year":2012},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":16239,"idMal":16239,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":72,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2012,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/16239","startDate":{"day":15,"month":12,"year":2012},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"One Piece: Episode of Luffy - Hand Island Adventure","native":"ONE PIECE エピソードオブルフィ 〜ハンドアイランドの冒険〜","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Episode of Luffy - Hand Island no Bouken","userPreferred":"One Piece: Episode of Luffy - Hand Island Adventure"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n16468-yOxhsBHFICtu.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#feae28","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b16468-pMKFwfY8lYZX.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b16468-pMKFwfY8lYZX.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b16468-pMKFwfY8lYZX.png"},"description":"An exclusive anime prologue to One Piece Film Z with an original story penned by manga creator Eiichiro Oda. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network) ","duration":5,"endDate":{"day":30,"month":12,"year":2012},"episodes":2,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":16468,"idMal":16468,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":69,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2012,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/16468","startDate":{"day":23,"month":12,"year":2012},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece: Glorious Island","One Piece Special: Glorious Island","ワンピース フィルム ゼット グロリアス アイランド"],"title":{"native":"ONE PIECE FILM Z『GLORIOUS ISLAND』","romaji":"ONE PIECE FILM: Z - GLORIOUS ISLAND","userPreferred":"ONE PIECE FILM: Z - GLORIOUS ISLAND"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/15323-zrax5OGlGepE.png","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#fed628","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/15323.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/15323.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/15323.jpg"},"description":"A retelling of the Arlong Park arc, with new animation.","duration":105,"endDate":{"day":25,"month":8,"year":2012},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":15323,"idMal":15323,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":78,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2012,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/15323","startDate":{"day":25,"month":8,"year":2012},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Special"],"title":{"native":"ONE PIECE エピソードオブナミ 〜航海士の涙と仲間の絆〜","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Episode of Nami - Koukaishi no Namida to Nakama no Kizuna","userPreferred":"ONE PIECE: Episode of Nami - Koukaishi no Namida to Nakama no Kizuna"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SUMMARY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/19123-QyRShJCfnIWD.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4c95d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx19123-leET1CrSJknT.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx19123-leET1CrSJknT.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx19123-leET1CrSJknT.jpg"},"description":"The story arcs aboard the Straw Hat Crew's first ship Going Merry (Merry Go in some adaptations) are recreated with brand-new animation, from Luffy and Usopp's fight and Robin's disappearance to the crew's final farewell to the ship. Going Merry is treated as another member of the Straw Hats as Luffy, Zoro, Nami, and the rest of the crew set sail for the legendary treasure, the One Piece.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":106,"endDate":{"day":24,"month":8,"year":2013},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":19123,"idMal":19123,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":78,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2013,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/19123","startDate":{"day":24,"month":8,"year":2013},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Special"],"title":{"english":"One Piece: Episode of Merry - The Tale of One More Friend","native":"ONE PIECE エピソードオブメリー 〜もうひとりの仲間の物語〜","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Episode of Merry - Mou Hitori no Nakama no Monogatari","userPreferred":"One Piece: Episode of Merry - The Tale of One More Friend"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SUMMARY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20835-aR8CuXvtzqND.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e47850","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20835-QVV6LpJlqe1A.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20835-QVV6LpJlqe1A.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20835-QVV6LpJlqe1A.jpg"},"description":"This new TV special tells the two years of Luffy's training with Silvers Rayleigh in Rusukaina Island after the Battle of Marineford, which has never been told in the manga or TV anime. It also features a new villain named Burndy World who is known as \"The Destroyer of the World\" and has the power of the MoaMoa Fruit (its ability is still unknown). Luffy has to protect Boa Hancock from the new enemy who escaped from the level 6 of Impel Down. He is newly designed by the original creator of the manga, Eiichiro Oda.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":107,"endDate":{"day":30,"month":8,"year":2014},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Action","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":20835,"idMal":25161,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":76,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2014,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/20835","startDate":{"day":30,"month":8,"year":2014},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Special 15th Anniversary"],"title":{"english":"One Piece 3D2Y: Overcome Ace’s Death! Luffy’s Vow to his Friends","native":"ONE PIECE “3D2Y” エースの死を越えて! ルフィ仲間との誓い","romaji":"ONE PIECE \"3D2Y\": Ace no shi wo Koete! Luffy Nakama to no Chikai","userPreferred":"One Piece 3D2Y: Overcome Ace’s Death! Luffy’s Vow to his Friends"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21230-5yju21iK6aMW.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1a150","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21230-rfoUZud1Jn0L.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21230-rfoUZud1Jn0L.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21230-rfoUZud1Jn0L.png"},"description":"The anime will explore the childhood bond between Luffy, Ace and Sabo.","duration":110,"endDate":{"day":22,"month":8,"year":2015},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama"],"id":21230,"idMal":31289,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":74,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2015,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21230","startDate":{"day":22,"month":8,"year":2015},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece: Episode of Sabo - The Three Brothers' Bond: The Miraculous Reunion and the Inherited Will"],"title":{"english":"One Piece - Episode of Sabo: Bond of Three Brothers - A Miraculous Reunion and an Inherited Will","native":"ONE PIECE エピソードオブサボ ~3兄弟の絆 奇跡の再会と受け継がれる意志~","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Episode of Sabo - 3-Kyoudai no Kizuna Kiseki no Saikai to Uketsugareru Ishi","userPreferred":"One Piece - Episode of Sabo: Bond of Three Brothers - A Miraculous Reunion and an Inherited Will"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SUMMARY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21485-lPFbmxGrFsBX.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4bb43","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/21485-KR1sv4rYSe6V.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/21485-KR1sv4rYSe6V.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/21485-KR1sv4rYSe6V.jpg"},"description":"The Davy Back Fight Arc competitors journey to New World with new crew members Dojaku, Kansho and tactical genius Komei for a meeting that will take place on a foggy island that makes devil fruit users unable to use to their abilities.","duration":116,"endDate":{"day":19,"month":12,"year":2015},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":21485,"idMal":32051,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":69,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2015,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21485","startDate":{"day":19,"month":12,"year":2015},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece - Aventura en Nebulandia"],"title":{"english":"One Piece: Adventure of Nebulandia","native":"ONE PIECE 〜アドベンチャー オブ ネブランディア〜","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Adventure of Nebulandia","userPreferred":"One Piece: Adventure of Nebulandia"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21831-Xl4r2uBaaKU4.png","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1a10d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21831-qj5IKYiPOupF.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21831-qj5IKYiPOupF.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21831-qj5IKYiPOupF.jpg"},"description":"The Straw Hat Pirates meet Olga, a girl who has escaped the island Alchemi. Alchemi was known for its metal production, and for the creation of the extremely valuable Pure Gold, but the island disappeared two hundred years ago. Olga is now being pursued by Marines, interested in Pure Gold. Gildo Tesoro, who controls the Navy HQ and black market, hears of Olga and hires treasure hunter Mad Treasure to track her down. The Straw Hats join forces with Olga in search of the Pure Gold, while she plots to takes advantage of them and use the treasure to become rich herself.","duration":104,"endDate":{"day":16,"month":7,"year":2016},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":21831,"idMal":33338,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2016,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21831","startDate":{"day":16,"month":7,"year":2016},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"One Piece: Heart of Gold","native":"ONE PIECE 〜ハートオブゴールド〜","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Heart of Gold","userPreferred":"One Piece: Heart of Gold"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/99302-v3NwmsSnjj94.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#bbe45d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx99302-b40WIhc5dylo.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx99302-b40WIhc5dylo.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx99302-b40WIhc5dylo.jpg"},"description":"The special will be a completely new work, featuring reanimated scenes from the beginning of the series through when the crew enters the Grand Line.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nThe special is commemorating the manga's 20th anniversary, and will also feature anime versions of the original manga's chapter cover stories as part of the special's ending credits. The staff haven't yet clarified which cover story or stories will be animated. Additionally, the anime will feature a special 20th anniversary commemoration version of the original opening theme song \"We Are!\".\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":106,"endDate":{"day":26,"month":8,"year":2017},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama"],"id":99302,"idMal":36215,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":76,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2017,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/99302","startDate":{"day":26,"month":8,"year":2017},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"One Piece: Episode of East Blue","native":"ONE PIECE エピソードオブ東の海〜ルフィと4人の仲間の大冒険!!〜","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Episode of East Blue - Luffy to 4-nin no Nakama no Daibouken","userPreferred":"One Piece: Episode of East Blue"},"trailer":{"id":"XcWmgU7X-Is","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XcWmgU7X-Is/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SUMMARY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/459-JqlCjcwxxFrr.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e40d0d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx459-Ivw65mUXackh.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx459-Ivw65mUXackh.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx459-Ivw65mUXackh.png"},"description":"There once was a pirate known as the Great Gold Pirate Woonan, who obtained almost 1/3 of the world's gold. Over the course of a few years, the pirate's existence faded, and a legend grew that he disappeared with his gold to a remote island, an island pirates continue to search for. Aboard the Going Merry, Luffy and his crew, starved and reckless, are robbed of their treasure. In an attempt to get it back, they wreck the getaway ship, guided by a young boy named Tabio, who's a captured part of El Drago's pirate crew. El Drago's love for gold has driven him to look for Woonan's island, and thanks to Woonan's treasure map, he finds it. During this time, Luffy's crew have been split up, and despite their own circumstances, they must find a way to stop El Drago from obtaining Woonan's gold. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":50,"endDate":{"day":4,"month":3,"year":2000},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":459,"idMal":459,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":68,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2000,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/459","startDate":{"day":4,"month":3,"year":2000},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece: The Movie","One Piece (2000)","One Piece: La Película","วันพีซ เดอะมูฟวี่ 1 เกาะสมบัติแห่งวูนัน","Vua Hải Tặc: Đảo Châu Báu","One Piece: Golden Island Adventure","One Piece - Per tutto l'oro del mondo"],"title":{"english":"ONE PIECE: The Movie","native":"ONE PIECE (Movie)","romaji":"ONE PIECE (Movie)","userPreferred":"ONE PIECE: The Movie"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/460-mWAlHAJ5MuBg.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4c943","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx460-p9HObfGUhWn0.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx460-p9HObfGUhWn0.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx460-p9HObfGUhWn0.jpg"},"description":"Informed by the Thief Brothers his ship has been stolen by the Trump Kyoudai (Trump Siblings) who have set up base on Clockwork Island. Monkey D. Luffy, Captain of the Going Merry and aspiring Pirate King works with his crew - Ussop, Zoro, Sanji and Nami to battle their way up Clockwork Island to reclaim their ship.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":55,"endDate":{"day":3,"month":3,"year":2001},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":460,"idMal":460,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":67,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2001,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/460","startDate":{"day":3,"month":3,"year":2001},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Movie 02","วันพีซ เดอะมูฟวี่ 2 การผจญภัยบนเกาะแห่งฟันเฟือง","Vua Hải Tặc: Cuộc phiêu lưu đến đảo máy đồng hồ ","One Piece - Avventura all'Isola Spirale"],"title":{"english":"One Piece: Clockwork Island Adventure","native":"ONE PIECE ねじまき島の冒険","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Nejimaki-jima no Bouken","userPreferred":"One Piece: Clockwork Island Adventure"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/461-0pvcIaXC0p70.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e49343","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx461-DC9fMDl3AaK1.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx461-DC9fMDl3AaK1.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx461-DC9fMDl3AaK1.jpg"},"description":"The crew comes upon Crown Island where the animals can talk and they makes Chopper their new king. But there are human hunters there also looking for the legendary horns that will give the person who consumes it immense power. Luffy and friends must stop them from destroying this animal kingdom.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":55,"endDate":{"day":2,"month":3,"year":2002},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":461,"idMal":461,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":64,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2002,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/461","startDate":{"day":2,"month":3,"year":2002},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Movie 03","วันพีซ เดอะมูฟวี่ 3 เกาะแห่งสรรพสัตว์และราชันย์ช็อปเปอร์ ","Vua Hải Tặc: Vương quốc Chopper trên đảo của những sinh vật lạ","One Piece: Chopper Kingdom of Strange Animal Island","One Piece - Il tesoro del re"],"title":{"english":"One Piece: Chopper’s Kingdom on the Island of Strange Animals","native":"ONE PIECE 珍獣島のチョッパー王国","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Chinjuu-jima no Chopper Oukoku","userPreferred":"One Piece: Chopper’s Kingdom on the Island of Strange Animals"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/462-Z074owEvilUu.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e49343","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx462-Ig8zfdsFWcql.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx462-Ig8zfdsFWcql.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx462-Ig8zfdsFWcql.png"},"description":"Luffy and crew arrive at the harbour of Anabaru. The local casino is holding a competition in which the winner will obtain a huge monetary reward if he reaches the finishing line first. Nami is elated and decides to participate in the competition. However, there is a conspiracy going behind the competition and the mastermind is an ex-military commander, Gasparde. His plan is to lure all the pirates to the military base and send them to their deaths. Luffy and gang have to overcome the numerous tests and tribulations along the way to complete this dead-end adventure. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":95,"endDate":{"day":1,"month":3,"year":2003},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":462,"idMal":462,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":72,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2003,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/462","startDate":{"day":1,"month":3,"year":2003},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Movie 04","One Piece: La Aventura sin Salida","The Adventure of Deadend","One Piece: Dead End","วันพีซ เดอะมูฟวี่ 4 การผจญภัยที่เดดเอนด์","Vua Hải Tặc: Cuộc đua tử thần","One Piece - Trappola mortale"],"title":{"english":"One Piece The Movie: The Dead End Adventure","native":"ONE PIECE THE MOVIE デッドエンドの冒険","romaji":"ONE PIECE THE MOVIE: Dead End no Bouken","userPreferred":"One Piece The Movie: The Dead End Adventure"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/463-zgU5XjUCR7Kv.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e45078","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx463-QDnETPoHp9oD.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx463-QDnETPoHp9oD.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx463-QDnETPoHp9oD.jpg"},"description":"Luffy and crew go to an island searching for a legendary sword, said to be the most expensive in the world. Soon attacking marines and beautiful maidens split the crew. Zoro betrays the crew to help an old friend, Luffy and Usopp wander through a cave, and the rest help a village fight marines. When Zoro defeats Sanji he takes the sacred pearls that are the only defense against the evil sword that will plunge the world into darkness. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":95,"endDate":{"day":6,"month":3,"year":2004},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":463,"idMal":463,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":67,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2004,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/463","startDate":{"day":6,"month":3,"year":2004},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Movie 05","One Piece: La Maldición de la Espada Sagrada","One Piece: The Cursed Holy Sword","One Piece : La malédiction de l'épée sacrée","วันพีซ เดอะมูฟวี่ 5 วันดวลดาบ ต้องสาปมรณะ ","Vua Hải Tặc: Thánh kiếm bị nguyền rủa","One Piece - Der Fluch des heiligen Schwerts","One Piece - La spada delle sette stelle"],"title":{"english":"One Piece: The Curse of the Sacred Sword","native":"ONE PIECE 呪われた聖剣","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Norowareta Seiken","userPreferred":"One Piece: The Curse of the Sacred Sword"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/464-wmQoE1Ywxghs.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4a15d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx464-g4wcZPjbhY5j.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx464-g4wcZPjbhY5j.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx464-g4wcZPjbhY5j.png"},"description":"The Straw Hat crew obtain an advertisement for a recreational island on the Grand Line run by the Baron Omatsuri. Luffy decides to take this opportunity to kick back and relax. Unfortunately, when they arrive at the island, they are asked to compete in contests through unity for access to relaxation. However, there seems to be a mysterious air on the island, as the Straw Hat Pirates begin to fight amongst themselves, while Robin, Chopper, and Luffy individually search for the secret behind Baron Omatsuri's island.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":91,"endDate":{"day":5,"month":3,"year":2005},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":464,"idMal":464,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":78,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2005,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/464","startDate":{"day":5,"month":3,"year":2005},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Movie 6","One Piece: El barón Omatsuri y la isla de los secretos","One Piece - L'isola segreta del barone Omatsuri"],"title":{"english":"One Piece: Baron Omatsuri and the Secret Island","native":"ONE PIECE THE MOVIE オマツリ男爵と秘密の島","romaji":"ONE PIECE THE MOVIE: Omatsuri Danshaku to Himitsu no Shima","userPreferred":"One Piece: Baron Omatsuri and the Secret Island"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/465-dYMZ6SHNeOkL.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#43aeff","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx465-qSRr0MKYhS0I.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx465-qSRr0MKYhS0I.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx465-qSRr0MKYhS0I.jpg"},"description":"The crew salvages a treasure chest from a sinking wreck, but inside turns out to be an old lady hiding. To get the Straw Hat Pirates to take her home, she promises them the treasure of a golden crown on her island, Mecha Island. When they arrive, their ship is first attacked by the lord of the island. But later he decides to use the pirates to help him solve the riddle of the Golden Crown.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":94,"endDate":{"day":4,"month":3,"year":2006},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":465,"idMal":465,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":68,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2006,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/465","startDate":{"day":4,"month":3,"year":2006},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece: Karakuri Shiro no Mecha Kyohei","One Piece Movie 07","One Piece: El gran soldado mecánico del castillo Karakuri","The Giant Mechanical Soldier of Karakuri Castle","One Piece: Schloss Karakuris Metall-Soldaten","One Piece - I misteri dell'isola meccanica"],"title":{"english":"One Piece: Mega Mecha Soldier of Karakuri Castle","native":"ONE PIECE THE MOVIE カラクリ城のメカ巨兵","romaji":"ONE PIECE THE MOVIE: Karakuri-jou no Mecha Kyohei","userPreferred":"One Piece: Mega Mecha Soldier of Karakuri Castle"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2107-Je0JIEoxx1VF.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4a143","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2107-H8bRuRRbhCIJ.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx2107-H8bRuRRbhCIJ.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2107-H8bRuRRbhCIJ.jpg"},"description":"A retelling of the Alabasta arc. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nRevolution is brewing in the desert country of Alabasta, but the Straw Hats and Princess Vivi know the truth: it's all a plot cooked up by Crocodile. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Netflix)","duration":90,"endDate":{"day":3,"month":3,"year":2007},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"id":2107,"idMal":2107,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":70,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2007,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/2107","startDate":{"day":3,"month":3,"year":2007},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Movie 8: Episode of Alabasta - The Desert Princess and the Pirates","One Piece Película 8: La saga del Arabasta - Los piratas y la princesa del desierto","One Piece Movie 08","One Piece - Un'amicizia oltre i confini del mare"],"title":{"english":"One Piece: The Desert Princess and the Pirates, Adventures in Alabasta","native":"ONE PIECE エピソードオブアラバスタ 砂漠の王女と海賊たち","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Episode of Alabasta - Sabaku no Oujo to Kaizoku-tachi","userPreferred":"One Piece: The Desert Princess and the Pirates, Adventures in Alabasta"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SUMMARY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3848-LXsSQtSFu4e9.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4e450","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3848-SCnYGTn34Llt.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx3848-SCnYGTn34Llt.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3848-SCnYGTn34Llt.jpg"},"description":"The movie is a retelling of the Drum Island arc with new music and animation. Vivi has been removed from the plot while both Nico Robin and Franky, who joined the crew after the Drum Island arc, have been added. The movie also has the Straw Hat's new ship, the Thousand Sunny. It has been stated that Oda will be creating a new character for this movie, Wapol's older brother, Mushul, who also appears to be a Devil Fruit user. \u003cbr\u003e","duration":113,"endDate":{"day":1,"month":3,"year":2008},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":3848,"idMal":3848,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":71,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2008,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/3848","startDate":{"day":1,"month":3,"year":2008},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Miracle Sakura","One Piece: Episodio de Chopper + El milagro del cerezo en invierno","One Piece: Episode of Chopper Plus - Bloom in the Winter, Miracle Sakura","One Piece Movie 09","One Piece - Il miracolo dei ciliegi in fiore"],"title":{"english":"One Piece: Episode Of Chopper +: The Miracle Winter Cherry Blossom","native":"ONE PIECE THE MOVIE エピソードオブチョッパー+ 冬に咲く、奇跡の桜","romaji":"ONE PIECE THE MOVIE: Episode of Chopper Plus - Fuyu ni Saku, Kiseki no Sakura","userPreferred":"One Piece: Episode Of Chopper +: The Miracle Winter Cherry Blossom"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SUMMARY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4155-2PkLjTHddz2s.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4ae50","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4155-P5TDf6t6qFwX.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx4155-P5TDf6t6qFwX.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4155-P5TDf6t6qFwX.png"},"description":"The story begins somewhere between the Thriller Bark arc and the Sabaody Archipelago arc. The main villain's name is \"Golden Lion\" Shiki. 20 years ago he lost a battle against Monkey D. Garp and Sengoku and was imprisoned in Impel Down, but managed to escape. After that he starts to collect his crew and steals Nami to make her his navigator. Luffy tries to get to Shiki's hideout to free his friend. ","duration":113,"endDate":{"day":12,"month":12,"year":2009},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":4155,"idMal":4155,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":78,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2009,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/4155","startDate":{"day":12,"month":12,"year":2009},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Film 10","ワンピース ストロング ワールド","One Piece: Strong World","One Piece - Avventura sulle isole volanti"],"title":{"english":"One Piece Film: Strong World","native":"ONE PIECE FILM STRONG WORLD","romaji":"ONE PIECE FILM: STRONG WORLD","userPreferred":"One Piece Film: Strong World"},"trailer":{"id":"3n58UPvcD7I","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3n58UPvcD7I/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9999-T5jCX3o3cxeN.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#ffa100","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/9999.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/9999.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/9999.jpg"},"description":"The entire Straw Hat crew began to search for Luffy's important straw hat after he woke up finding it missing.","duration":30,"endDate":{"day":19,"month":3,"year":2011},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":9999,"idMal":9999,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":65,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2011,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/9999","startDate":{"day":19,"month":3,"year":2011},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece 3D: Straw Hat Chase","One Piece 3D - L'inseguimento di Cappello di Paglia"],"title":{"english":"One Piece 3D: Mugiwara Chase","native":"ONE PIECE 3D 麦わらチェイス","romaji":"ONE PIECE 3D: Mugiwara Chase","userPreferred":"One Piece 3D: Mugiwara Chase"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/12859-XjlBW6o2YwUb.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1ae5d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx12859-uQFENDPzMWz6.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx12859-uQFENDPzMWz6.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx12859-uQFENDPzMWz6.jpg"},"description":"Said to be comparable to the Ancient Weapons of old, the Marines’ trump card, the “Dyna Stones,” have suddenly been stolen by a group of renegade vigilantes. The terrifyingly powerful man responsible, former Marine Admiral “Z”, now stands in the path of Luffy and his Straw Hat Pirates. Can the Straw Hats defeat “Z” and his crew, or will the New World meet its end at the hands of this mad man? \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Funimation)","duration":107,"endDate":{"day":15,"month":12,"year":2012},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama"],"id":12859,"idMal":12859,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2012,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/12859","startDate":{"day":15,"month":12,"year":2012},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Film 12: Z","海贼王剧场版Z","One Piece Gold - Il film"],"title":{"english":"One Piece Film: Z","native":"ONE PIECE FILM Z","romaji":"ONE PIECE FILM: Z","userPreferred":"One Piece Film: Z"},"trailer":{"id":"1gGt1Mg_zSo","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1gGt1Mg_zSo/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21335-ps20iVSGUXbD.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1bb35","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx21335-XsXdE0AeOkkZ.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx21335-XsXdE0AeOkkZ.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx21335-XsXdE0AeOkkZ.jpg"},"description":"In One Piece Film Gold, The Straw Hats are at it again in an all-new high-flying adventure! A gripping tale unfolds in the spectacular city of Gran Tesoro, where Luffy and his crew are drawn by dreams of hitting the jackpot. With so much luck, Luffy's winning streak can't possibly end. But behind the gilded curtains lies a powerful king whose deep pockets and deeper ambitions spell disaster for all.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: FUNimation)","duration":120,"endDate":{"day":23,"month":7,"year":2016},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":21335,"idMal":31490,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":77,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2016,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21335","startDate":{"day":23,"month":7,"year":2016},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Film 13","航海王之黄金城"],"title":{"english":"One Piece Film: Gold","native":"ONE PIECE FILM GOLD","romaji":"ONE PIECE FILM: GOLD","userPreferred":"One Piece Film: Gold"},"trailer":{"id":"_shEgcWHC2U","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_shEgcWHC2U/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n96427-UsjDRx1o4V8V.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4861a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx96427-XiDc44cTlf29.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/bx96427-XiDc44cTlf29.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/small/bx96427-XiDc44cTlf29.png"},"description":"One Piece: Loguetown Arc is a novelization of Eiichiro Oda's intended story elements for the Loguetown Arc, later used in the anime as a filler (Episodes 50-51).\n","endDate":{},"format":"NOVEL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":96427,"idMal":94534,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":76,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/manga/96427","startDate":{"day":17,"month":7,"year":2000},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["ONE PIECE: Loguetown Arc","Logue Town"],"title":{"native":"ONE PIECE ローグタウン編","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Loguetown-hen","userPreferred":"ONE PIECE: Loguetown-hen"},"type":"MANGA"},"relationType":"SOURCE"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30013-hbbRZqC5MjYh.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1935d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30013-BeslEMqiPhlk.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/bx30013-BeslEMqiPhlk.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/small/bx30013-BeslEMqiPhlk.jpg"},"description":"As a child, Monkey D. Luffy was inspired to become a pirate by listening to the tales of the buccaneer \"Red-Haired\" Shanks. But his life changed when Luffy accidentally ate the Gum-Gum Devil Fruit and gained the power to stretch like rubber...at the cost of never being able to swim again! Years later, still vowing to become the king of the pirates, Luffy sets out on his adventure...one guy alone in a rowboat, in search of the legendary \"One Piece,\" said to be the greatest treasure in the world...\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: VIZ Media)","endDate":{},"format":"MANGA","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":30013,"idMal":13,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":91,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/manga/30013","startDate":{"day":22,"month":7,"year":1997},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["원피스","וואן פיס ","One Piece - Большой куш","ワンピース","ONE PIECE～航海王～","วั